    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A post office opened in Brashear in 1899, marking the town’s first federal presence.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brashear%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first school in Brashear opened the same year the post office, and by 1905 it served 149 students.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brashear%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1948 Brashear boasted six stores, four churches, a two‑teacher school, and a cotton gin.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brashear%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During the late 1980s the community still had four churches, a factory, a post office, and scattered homes, reflecting its rural character.",
